ceipt, including after a roll; it never rerolls, rolls back randomness or overwrites later manual candidate edits. Only the receipt/original roll is immutable; candidate base stats remain manually editable within CORE-200 1..35. Canceling version editing preserves the prior currentVersion and does not erase its attempt receipt."
